  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb, no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Very often used reflexively: **cepillarse** (to brush one's own hair/teeth), e.g. *cepillarse los dientes* (to brush one's teeth), *cepillarse el pelo* (to brush one's hair)",
    "Common usage: *cepillar al perro* (to brush the dog), *cepillar la ropa* (to brush clothing)",
    "Related noun: **el cepillo** (the brush) — *el cepillo de dientes* (toothbrush)"
  ],
